      "dcterms:title": "NON–ABELIAN REIDEMEISTER TORSION FOR TWIST KNOTS",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "JÉR ÔME DUBOIS, VU HUYNH",
        "YAMAGUCHI, YOSHIKAZU"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20210726",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/0706.2213",
      "dcterms:abstract": "This paper gives an explicit formula for the SL 2(C)−non–abelian Reidemeister torsion as deﬁned in [Dub06] in the case of twist knots. For hyperbolic twist knots, we also prove that the non–abelian Reidemeister torsion at the holonomy representation can be expressed as a rational function evaluated at the cusp shape of the knot.",
